{
  "enabled": true,
  "name": "Performance Targets Validator",
  "description": "Validate code meets performance targets: <2s startup, <150MB memory, 60fps",
  "version": "1",
  "when": {
    "type": "fileEdited",
    "patterns": [
      "flutter_chat_app/lib/main*.dart",
      "flutter_chat_app/lib/core/initialization/**/*.dart",
      "flutter_chat_app/lib/presentation/pages/**/*.dart",
      "flutter_chat_app/lib/presentation/widgets/**/*.dart"
    ]
  },
  "then": {
    "type": "askAgent",
    "prompt": "Validate against performance targets:\n\n**PROJECT PERFORMANCE TARGETS:**\n- 🚀 Startup time: <2s\n- 💾 Memory usage: <150MB\n- 🎯 Auth operations: <100ms\n- 📨 Message delivery: <100ms\n- 🎨 UI rendering: 60fps (16.67ms per frame)\n\n**STARTUP OPTIMIZATION (main.dart, initialization):**\n\n**Check for:**\n❌ Synchronous initialization\n❌ Heavy computations in main()\n❌ Blocking database operations\n❌ Unnecessary service initialization\n❌ Large asset loading\n\n**Correct Pattern:**\n```dart\nvoid main() async {\n  WidgetsFlutterBinding.ensureInitialized();\n  \n  // 1. Critical services only\n  await configureDependencies();\n  \n  // 2. Defer non-critical initialization\n  runApp(const MyApp());\n  \n  // 3. Initialize in background\n  WidgetsBinding.instance.addPostFrameCallback((_) {\n    _initializeNonCriticalServices();\n  });\n}\n\nFuture<void> _initializeNonCriticalServices() async {\n  // Analytics, crash reporting, etc.\n  await Future.wait([\n    getIt<AnalyticsService>().initialize(),\n    getIt<CrashReporter>().initialize(),\n  ]);\n}\n```\n\n**MEMORY OPTIMIZATION:**\n\n**Check for:**\n❌ Large lists without ListView.builder\n❌ Caching too much data\n❌ Not disposing controllers\n❌ Memory leaks (listeners, streams)\n❌ Large images without caching\n\n**Correct Pattern:**\n```dart\n// Use ListView.builder for long lists\nListView.builder(\n  itemCount: messages.length,\n  itemExtent: 80.0, // Fixed height for better performance\n  itemBuilder: (context, index) {\n    return MessageItem(message: messages[index]);\n  },\n)\n\n// Dispose resources\n@override\nvoid dispose() {\n  _controller.dispose();\n  _subscription.cancel();\n  super.dispose();\n}\n\n// Cache images\nCachedNetworkImage(\n  imageUrl: url,\n  memCacheWidth: 200, // Resize for memory\n  placeholder: (context, url) => const CircularProgressIndicator(),\n)\n```\n\n**60FPS RENDERING:**\n\n**Check for:**\n❌ Heavy computations in build()\n❌ Missing const constructors\n❌ Unnecessary rebuilds\n❌ Complex widget trees\n❌ Synchronous I/O in build()\n\n**Correct Pattern:**\n```dart\n// Use const constructors\nclass MessageBubble extends StatelessWidget {\n  const MessageBubble({super.key, required this.message});\n  \n  @override\n  Widget build(BuildContext context) {\n    // Keep build() simple and fast\n    return const Card(\n      child: Text('Message'),\n    );\n  }\n}\n\n// Avoid rebuilding entire tree\nBlocSelector<ChatBloc, ChatState, bool>(\n  selector: (state) => state.isLoading,\n  builder: (context, isLoading) {\n    // Only rebuilds when isLoading changes\n    return isLoading ? const LoadingIndicator() : const SizedBox();\n  },\n)\n\n// Use RepaintBoundary for complex widgets\nRepaintBoundary(\n  child: ComplexAnimatedWidget(),\n)\n```\n\n**AUTH OPERATIONS (<100ms):**\n\n**Check for:**\n❌ Synchronous token validation\n❌ Multiple database queries\n❌ Network calls in auth check\n❌ Heavy encryption operations\n\n**Correct Pattern:**\n```dart\n@override\nFuture<Either<Failure, bool>> isLoggedIn() async {\n  try {\n    // Fast local check only\n    final token = await _secureStorage.read(key: 'auth_token');\n    return Right(token != null && token.isNotEmpty);\n  } catch (e) {\n    return Left(CacheFailure(message: '$e'));\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**MESSAGE DELIVERY (<100ms):**\n\n**Check for:**\n❌ Waiting for server response\n❌ Synchronous database writes\n❌ Heavy data processing\n❌ Image compression in main thread\n\n**Correct Pattern:**\n```dart\n@override\nFuture<Either<Failure, Message>> sendMessage(Message message) async {\n  // 1. Save locally immediately (optimistic update)\n  final localMessage = message.copyWith(\n    status: MessageStatus.pending,\n    timestamp: DateTime.now(),\n  );\n  \n  await _localDataSource.saveMessage(localMessage);\n  \n  // 2. Queue for background sync\n  _syncQueue.enqueue(localMessage);\n  \n  // 3. Return immediately\n  return Right(localMessage.toEntity());\n  \n  // Server sync happens in background\n}\n```\n\n**PERFORMANCE MONITORING:**\n\n**Add Performance Tracking:**\n```dart\n// Track operation time\nfinal stopwatch = Stopwatch()..start();\ntry {\n  final result = await operation();\n  stopwatch.stop();\n  \n  if (stopwatch.elapsedMilliseconds > 100) {\n    logger.w('Slow operation: ${stopwatch.elapsedMilliseconds}ms');\n  }\n  \n  return result;\n} catch (e) {\n  stopwatch.stop();\n  rethrow;\n}\n```\n\n**REPORT FORMAT:**\n```\n⚡ PERFORMANCE ANALYSIS:\n\n✅ Startup: Deferred initialization detected\n⚠️ Memory: Found ListView without builder (line 45)\n✅ Rendering: All widgets use const constructors\n❌ Auth: Synchronous token validation (line 123) - Should be async\n✅ Messages: Optimistic updates implemented\n\n🎯 TARGETS:\n- Startup: ✅ <2s (estimated)\n- Memory: ⚠️ Review ListView usage\n- Rendering: ✅ 60fps capable\n- Auth: ❌ Needs optimization\n- Messages: ✅ <100ms\n\nOVERALL: 4/5 targets met\n```\n\n**SUGGESTIONS:**\nProvide specific optimizations for any violations found, with code examples and performance impact estimates.\n\nPerformance is critical for user experience!"
  }
}
